vertex="1" parent="b4"><mxGeometry x="0" y="40" width="298.8" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b6" value="«control» (from US4)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ViewUserProfileController&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;swimlaneFillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506.8" y="228" width="298.8" height="68" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b7" value="+getUserProfile(profileId): UserProfile" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="b6"><mxGeometry x="0" y="40" width="298.8" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b8" value="The controller just calls the entity and returns&lt;br&gt;the account (or None) - one call, no checks.&lt;br&gt;The profile name comes from US4's controller.&lt;br&gt;Precondition: logged in as a User Admin (UC1).&lt;br&gt;loginRequired in app.py only sends someone with&lt;br&gt;no session to /login." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=10;fillColor=#FFF9C4;strokeColor=#B8A100;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="506.8" y="356" width="298.8" height="98" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="b9" value="«entity»&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;UserAccount&lt;/b&gt;" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=top;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=40;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=0;marginBottom=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#2E7D32;swimlaneFill